{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061911/block/singleImage/3257332/wm/01M6JT2B6MAEST96VE64BKC321.jpg?updatedAt=1793780248\"/><figcaption>今期攪珠獎金高達1億800萬。(鍾式明攝)</figcaption></figure><p>上周六（10月31日）六合彩萬聖節金多寶攪珠，因8,000萬元頭獎基金無人中，故本周四(11月5日)攪珠獎金高達1億800萬，截止售票時間為當晚9時15分，攪珠時間為當晚9時30分。 在最近50期攪珠，攪出最多號碼為31號，出現17次，之後為7號，出現15次，至於34號出現12次。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:25:37.150434+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T02:48:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:38:20.976567+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:36.875660+00:00","content_hash":"a6d2d7a1e2fa79ef35c3abe3341ecdc0a30957ad5a3f823f2a682c2ebad81429","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:25:37.150434+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}